# ebridgesec allow file
#
# One probe serial per line, optionally followed by a description after a
# space or tab. Lines starting with '#' are comments; a '#' inside a serial
# is part of the serial. Serials are compared case-insensitive.
#
# The file is read again for every new main connection, so probes can be
# added or removed without restarting ebridgesec. A rejected serial is
# logged, so you can copy a new probe's serial from the log after it tried
# to connect once (only if you expect that connection).
#
#
# <serial>                   <description>

51FF71065067485753401787    STMf4 dev board
